      "template": "# Shannon Full Autonomous Pentest\n\nExecute a complete penetration test against the target:\n1. shannon_docker_init\n2. shannon_recon <target>\n3. shannon_vuln_discovery <target>\n4. shannon_browser <target> (if web app)\n5. shannon_idor_test <target> (if API)\n6. shannon_exploit <target>\n7. shannon_report\n8. shannon_docker_cleanup\n\nFollow the Shannon methodology. Update task list after each phase.",
      "description": "Full autonomous penetration test - recon to report"
    },
    "shannon-recon": {
      "template": "# Shannon Reconnaissance\n\nExecute reconnaissance against the target:\n1. shannon_docker_init\n2. shannon_recon <target>\n3. shannon_docker_cleanup\n\nGather: DNS, subdomains, ports, services, tech stack, entry points.",
      "description": "Reconnaissance only - information gathering"
    },
